# src/tychoc.c:6848@generic -- a nullary variant of a generic enum fixes no $T, and the
# qualified spelling has its own message (the bare one at src/tychoc.c:6644@generic names the enum).
# expect: lib.Empty is a variant of a generic enum; supply the type explicitly, e.g. lib.Empty$(int)
package main
